<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Teltrend rating trimmed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Teltrend rating trimmed.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Robinson-Humphrey analyst Greg Mesniaeff said Tuesday he trimmed his short-term rating on Teltrend Inc to a market performer from buy. Mesniaeff said he was maintaining his long-term rating of buy.</p>
<p>--Mesniaeff said he also cut his fiscal second quarter earnings estimate to $0.46 a share from $0.51. The quarter ends on January 31. According to First Call, the consensus of analysts' estimates is $0.49 a share versus $0.41 last year.</p>
</text>
